  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"672\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"672\">Method:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"752\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"752\">\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"752\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"710\">Luminex-based Solid Phase Assay</strong></span><br data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"713\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">(Multiplex bead-based flow cytometry)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"752\">\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"752\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Clinical Use / Interpretation:</span></strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"1107\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"846\">\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"846\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"846\">anti-HLA Class I IgG antibodies</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"999\">\n<p data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"857\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Used in:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"999\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"929\">\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"929\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"902\">Renal or organ transplant recipients</strong> (pre-transplant screening)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"999\">\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"999\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Sensitization due to <strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"999\">prior transplant, transfusion, pregnancy</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1040\">\n<p data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1040\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1014\">&lt;20% PRA</strong>: Low sensitization risk</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1107\">\n<p data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1107\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1055\">&gt;50% PRA</strong>: High immunological risk &ndash; may need desensitization</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
